,
"abot"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"使用飞书智能机器人发送消息和管理监听服务"
,
"en"
:
"Send messages and manage listener service using Feishu intelligent bot"
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x feishu abot send --text --chatid <chat_id> \"Hello\""
,
"cn"
:
"使用智能机器人发送文本消息"
,
"en"
:
"Send text messages using intelligent bot"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x feishu abot reply --msgid <message_id> \"Hello\""
,
"cn"
:
"使用智能机器人回复指定消息"
,
"en"
:
"Reply to a specified message using intelligent bot"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x feishu abot reaction add --msgid <message_id> THUMBSUP"
,
"cn"
:
"给指定消息添加表情回复"
,
"en"
:
"Add an emoji reaction to a specified message"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x feishu abot reaction rm --msgid <message_id> <reaction_id>"
,
"cn"
:
"删除指定消息的表情回复"
,
"en"
:
"Remove an emoji reaction from a specified message"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x feishu abot service start"
,
"cn"
:
"启动智能机器人监听服务"
,
"en"
:
"Start the intelligent bot listener service"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x feishu abot data which <chat_id>"
,
"cn"
:
"查看指定会话的数据文件路径"
,
"en"
:
"Show data file path for specified chat"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x feishu abot info"
,
"cn"
:
"获取当前应用的基础信息"
,
"en"
:
"Get basic information of the current app"
}
]
,
"info"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"获取飞书应用的基础信息"
,
"en"
:
"Get basic information of the Feishu app"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"app_id 是飞书应用的唯一标识（形如 cli_xxxxx），在飞书开放平台创建应用时获得\n省略 --appid 时使用 me，等同于查询当前已配置的应用\n查询其他应用的信息需额外申请「获取应用信息」权限（admin:app.info:readonly）\n"
,
"en"
:
"app_id is the unique identifier of a Feishu app (format: cli_xxxxx), obtained when creating the app on the Feishu Open Platform\nOmit --appid to use me, equivalent to querying the currently configured app\nQuerying other apps requires the \"Get app info\" scope (admin:app.info:readonly)\n"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"--id_type 用于指定返回信息中用户字段（creator_id、owner_id 等）的 ID 类型\nopen_id（默认）— 标识用户在当前应用中的身份，同一用户在不同应用中 open_id 不同\nunion_id — 标识用户在应用开发商下的身份，可跨同一开发商的多个应用关联同一用户\nuser_id — 标识用户在租户内的身份，同一租户内所有应用共享，需额外申请 contact:user.employee_id:readonly 权限\n一般情况下保持默认 open_id 即可；需要跨应用或跨租户打通用户数据时才需要切换\n"
,
"en"
:
"--id_type specifies the ID type for user fields in the response (e.g. creator_id, owner_id)\nopen_id (default) — identifies a user within the current app; same user has different open_ids across apps\nunion_id — identifies a user within the app vendor's apps, useful for correlating the same user across apps from the same vendor\nuser_id — identifies a user within a tenant; shared across all apps in the tenant (requires the contact:user.employee_id:readonly scope)\nKeep the default open_id in most cases; only switch when you need to correlate users across apps or tenants\n"
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x feishu abot info"
,
"cn"
:
"获取当前应用的信息（等同于 --appid me）"
,
"en"
:
"Get current app info (equivalent to --appid me)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x feishu abot info --appid <app_id>"
,
"cn"
:
"获取指定应用的信息"
,
"en"
:
"Get info of a specific app"
}
]
,
"--appid"
:
{
"#synopsis"
:
"<app_id>"
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"应用的 app id（省略则使用 me 查询当前应用）"
,
"en"
:
"App ID (defaults to me, the current app)"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"应用 ID"
,
"en"
:
"App ID"
}
}
}
,
