"reaction"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"管理消息的表情回复（reaction）"
,
"en"
:
"Manage emoji reactions on messages"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"emoji_type 的取值参见飞书表情文案说明：\nhttps://open.feishu.cn/document/uAjLw4CM/ukTMukTMukTM/reference/im-v1/message-reaction/emojis-introduce\n常用值：SMILE、THUMBSUP、DONE、OK、HEART 等\nadd 成功后会返回 reaction_id，rm 时需要用到；只能删除由自己添加的表情回复\n"
,
"en"
:
"For available emoji_type values, see the Feishu emoji reference:\nhttps://open.feishu.cn/document/uAjLw4CM/ukTMukTMukTM/reference/im-v1/message-reaction/emojis-introduce\nCommon values: SMILE, THUMBSUP, DONE, OK, HEART, etc.\nadd returns a reaction_id needed by rm; you can only remove reactions you added yourself\n"
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x feishu abot reaction add --msgid <message_id> THUMBSUP"
,
"cn"
:
"给指定消息添加一个「点赞」表情回复"
,
"en"
:
"Add a THUMBSUP reaction to the specified message"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x feishu abot reaction rm --msgid <message_id> <reaction_id>"
,
"cn"
:
"删除指定消息的某一表情回复"
,
"en"
:
"Remove the specified emoji reaction from the message"
}
]
,
