:
"使用交互模式初始化配置"
}
}
,
"login"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Login to create a Feishu bot via QR code scan"
,
"cn"
:
"扫描二维码登录创建飞书机器人"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"飞书机器人登录（x feishu login）\n用途：通过扫描飞书 App 中的二维码，创建并配置智能机器人\n该命令会获取 app_id 和 app_secret 并自动保存到配置\n登录成功后可直接使用智能机器人功能\n\n自动检测运行环境：\n  终端交互环境 - 自动进入阻塞模式，等待用户扫码后保存配置\n  非终端环境（Agent/管道） - 自动进入非阻塞模式，返回二维码和 session 后退出\n\nAgent 使用流程：\n  1. x feishu login         - 获取二维码\n  2. x feishu login --check  - 查询登录状态，扫码成功后自动保存配置\n"
,
"en"
:
"Feishu Bot Login (x feishu login)\nUse case: Create a Feishu intelligent bot by scanning a QR code with the Feishu App\nThis command retrieves app_id and app_secret and automatically saves them to the config\nAfter successful login, you can directly use the intelligent bot features\n\nAuto-detect runtime environment:\n  Interactive terminal - Blocking mode, waits for QR scan and saves config\n  Non-terminal (Agent/piped) - Non-blocking mode, returns QR code and session immediately\n\nAgent workflow:\n  1. x feishu login          - Get QR code\n  2. x feishu login --check   - Check status, saves config on successful scan\n"
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x feishu login"
,
"cn"
:
"扫描二维码登录创建飞书机器人"
,
"en"
:
"Scan QR code to login and create Feishu bot"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x feishu login --check"
,
"cn"
:
"查询登录状态（Agent 模式）"
,
"en"
:
"Check login status (agent mode)"
}
]
}
,
